    "Extremely easy to explain and visualize",
    "Captures non-linear rules natively",
    "Fast to predict"
  ],
  "cons": [
    "Prone to severe overfitting",
    "Often lower accuracy on its own",
    "Unstable (small data changes change the whole tree)"
  ],
